### room creat
POST http://localhost:5000/api/rooms
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer PASTE_TOKEN_HERE
{
    "name": "Premium Room",
    "pricePerNight": 4500,
    "capacity": 2,
    "description": "Premium room with balcony",
    "facilities": ["WiFi", "AC"],
    "totalInventory": 3
}

